<h1 class="text-left text-2xl text-gray-200 m-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
<h2 class="text-left text-xl text-gray-200 m-2 font-bold">Personally identifiable data</h2>
<div class="text-gray-200 text-left w-[400px] m-2">
  <p>We ask for your name, email, and password.</p>
  <p>We also get your profile photo from Gravatar.com. Their privacy policy is available <a class="underline" href="https://gravatar.com/privacy/">here</a>.</p>
</div>
<h2 class="text-left text-xl text-gray-200 m-2 font-bold">Other Data</h2>
<div class="text-gray-200 text-left w-[400px] m-2">
  <p>In order to use the app, you will have to add information to the app.</p>
  <p>We use Stripe.com to process payments. Any payment information you provide will be stored on Stripe.com. Their privacy policy is available <a class="underline" href="https://stripe.com/us/privacy">here</a>.</p>
  <p>We make use of Linode to host our servers and data. Their privacy policy is available <a class="underline" href="https://www.linode.com/privacy">here</a>.</p>
</div>
<h2 class="text-left text-xl text-gray-200 m-2 font-bold">How we use the data</h2>
<div class="text-gray-200 text-left w-[400px] m-2">
  Your email and password are needed to log into the app.
  Your name and profile photo are needed to enable team features.
  The data that you add to the app will only be used by you and members of teams that you belong to.
  Your email is also used to send notifications, release notes, and other important updates.
  If we discover that your data has been leaked, we will notify you within 60 days.
  If you delete your account, we will delete your data as soon as we can.
  We will not share your data with third parties or sell it to anyone.
  If required, we will share your data with law enforcement authorities in the United States and other jurisdictions.
</div>
